From: Shammah Chancellor <shammah.chancellor@notvalid.com>
Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 08:54:29 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] Stage complete V2 blocks through an abortable storage
 transaction

Reuse authenticated header, transaction, VM, cost and monetary checks without enumerating or copying the entire UTXO set. Separate operational storage failures from invalid blocks and abort every failed stage. Compare accepted roots, monetary bytes, invocation charges and rejection cases with the existing in-memory oracle. Publication remains the enclosing database integration responsibility.
